            <ATT name="Content"><![CDATA[#Wed Sep 30 08:07:56 CEST 2026
graphRagFuzzyThreshold=0.92
graphRagGroup=infrastructure
graphRagReviewBand=0.75
graphRagExtractionHints=Sites are named in infrastructure sections and network diagrams\: 'deux salles serveurs', 'sur chacun des deux sites', 'hébergé chez Digital Ocean, en data centers européens', 'Data Center', 'Location'. Extract one entity per distinct site; when a document only says 'two sites' without names, extract nothing.
graphRagMatch=fuzzy
]]></ATT>
            <ATT name="status">1970354901745664</ATT>
          </ATTRIBUTES>
